		"description": "<p>A phantasmal hand launches from you toward your target and clutches about their throat; digging sickly green claws into their flesh, it lifts them upward. A creature within 20ft becomes restrained and takes necrotic damage equal to your proficiency bonus, or 1d6 + proficiency bonus if cursed. They may use a bonus action to make Strength Saves to end the effect.</p>",
